{title: Guide Me, O Thou Great Jehovah}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]Guide me, [**]O Thou [F]great Je[G]hovah
[C]Pilgrim [F]through this [G]barren [C]land
[C]I am [**]weak, but [F]Thou art [G]mighty
[C]Hold me [F]with Thy [G]powerful [C]hand
[G]Bread of [Dm]Heaven, [C]bread of [Em]Heaven
[C]Feed me [F]‘til I want no [G]more[**]
[C]Feed me [Dm]‘til I [G]want no [C]more
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Open [**]now the [F]crystal [G]fountain
[C]Whence the [F]healing [G]stream doth [C]flow
[C]Let the [**]fire and [F]cloudy [G]pillar
[C]Lead me [F]all my [G]journey [C]through
[G]Strong De[Dm]liverer, [C]strong De[Em]liverer
[C]Be Thou [F]still my Strength and [G]Shield[**]
[C]Be Thou [Dm]still my [G]Strength and [C]Shield
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]When I [**]tread the [F]verge of [G]Jordan
[C]Bid my [F]anxious [G]fears sub[C]side
[C]Death of [**]death and [F]hell's des[G]truction
[C]Land me [F]safe on [G]Canaan's [C]side
[G]Songs of [Dm]praises, [C]songs of [Em]praises
[C]I will [F]ever give to [G]thee[**]
[C]I will [Dm]ever [G]give to [C]thee
{end_of_verse}
